882945}, {"pid": 879877292, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 8192, "score": 44, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 10:13", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879876815,47288722,1662]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=61422464]引长风[/uid] (2026-08-28 10:09):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大：谁说我不会超短？？？？[/quote]<br/><br/>[img]./mon_202608/28/axyfQ40-cux1KiT1kSf5-6x.jpg[/img]<br/>你猜我会不会。", "lou": 574, "content_length": 58, "attachs": [{"attachurl": "mon_202608/28/axyfQ40-cux1KiT1kSf5-6x.jpg", "size": 19, "type": "img", "subid": 0, "url_utf8_org_name": "image%2epng", "dscp": "", "path": "mon_202608/28", "name": "axyfQ40-cux1KiT1kSf5-6x.jpg", "ext": "jpg", "thumb": "56", "hash": ""}], "reply_to": 879876815, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787883188}, {"pid": 879878157, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 53, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 10:19", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "银行准备拉红了[s:ac:哭笑]", "lou": 575, "content_length": 12, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787883598}, {"pid": 879878820, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 115, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 10:24", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我这里给不出很明确的结论啊  这个又不是很简单的行情<br/>目前非常难做 做对了 可能吃的肉很多  但是大概率都是错的那种行情<br/>属于赢家通吃。没有雨露均沾<br/>我确实没办法。", "lou": 576, "content_length": 146, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787883880}, {"pid": 879879607, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 66, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 10:30", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "有色应该是预判博弈晚上沃十发言。这个我不去。我宁可做黄金的波动 前提是我觉得有机会的时候。", "lou": 577, "content_length": 88, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787884220}, {"pid": 879880491, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 55, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 10:3